{"seq":1,"slug":"prospect-theory","title":"前景理论与价值函数：行为经济学的核心模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations/prospect-theory","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"前景理论与价值函数-行为经济学的核心模型\">前景理论与价值函数：行为经济学的核心模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前景理论的三大支柱：<strong>参考点依赖</strong>（以当前状态为基准评估得失）、<strong>损失厌恶</strong>（损失权重约为收益的 2.25 倍）、<strong>概率权重扭曲</strong>（过高估计小概率，过低估计高概率）。这三者共同解释了标准期望效用理论无法涵盖的大量真实决策现象。</p>\n<p>前景理论（Prospect Theory）由 Daniel Kahneman 与 Amos Tversky 于 1979 年提出，2002 年为 Kahneman 赢得诺贝尔经济学奖。它用两个函数——<strong>价值函数</strong>（value function）和<strong>概率权重函数</strong>（probability weighting function）——替代了传统期望效用理论（Expected Utility Theory），解释了大量经典悖论和现实中的系统性决策偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"期望效用理论的困境\">期望效用理论的困境</h2><p>传统经济学以期望效用理论（von Neumann-Morgenstern，1944）作为理性决策的规范框架。在此框架下，决策者对财富水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 有一个凹形效用函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，做决策时最大化期望效用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum p_i \\cdot U(x_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>然而，现实中大量实验揭示了系统性违背：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>悖论</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>对 EUT 的挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Allais 悖论</strong>（1953）</td>\n<td>在两组选择中，人们的偏好违反独立性公理</td>\n<td>EUT 的概率独立性假设失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>得失不对称</strong></td>\n<td>失去 100 元的痛苦远大于获得 100 元的快乐</td>\n<td>EUT 无法解释参考点依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>彩票偏好</strong></td>\n<td>人们同时购买保险和彩票</td>\n<td>单一凹形效用函数无法自洽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>框架效应</strong></td>\n<td>同一信息用&quot;存活率 90%&quot;vs&quot;死亡率 10%&quot;描述，选择不同</td>\n<td>EUT 要求描述不变性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"价值函数-三大特征\">价值函数：三大特征</h2><p>前景理论的核心是<strong>价值函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它描述人们对<strong>收益/损失</strong>（而非绝对财富水平）的主观感受。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[参考点] --&gt; B[收益区域: 凹形, 边际递减]&#10;    A --&gt; C[损失区域: 凸形, 边际递减]&#10;    C --&gt; D[斜率更陡峭: 损失厌恶系数 λ≈2.25]\">graph LR\n    A[参考点] --&gt; B[收益区域: 凹形, 边际递减]\n    A --&gt; C[损失区域: 凸形, 边际递减]\n    C --&gt; D[斜率更陡峭: 损失厌恶系数 λ≈2.25]</pre><p><strong>特征一：参考点依赖（Reference Dependence）</strong></p>\n<p>人们对结果的评估不是基于最终财富水平，而是基于相对于某个参考点（通常是现状）的变化。同样是&quot;拥有 1000 元&quot;，如果参考点是 800 元，感受为&quot;盈利 200 元&quot;；如果参考点是 1200 元，感受为&quot;亏损 200 元&quot;——两种感受截然不同。</p>\n<p><strong>特征二：损失厌恶（Loss Aversion）</strong></p>\n<p>价值函数在损失区域的斜率比收益区域更陡峭。实验估计损失厌恶系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span>，即：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(-x) \\approx -\\lambda \\cdot v(x), \\quad \\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着<strong>失去 1 元的痛苦，相当于获得约 2.25 元的快乐</strong>。这一不对称性解释了禀赋效应（endowment effect）——人们对自己拥有的东西开价往往高于愿意支付的价格。</p>\n<p><strong>特征三：边际敏感度递减（Diminishing Sensitivity）</strong></p>\n<p>在收益和损失两侧，价值函数都呈现边际敏感度递减。收益区域为凹形（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v&#x27;&#x27; &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），损失区域为凸形（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v&#x27;&#x27; &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从 0 元到 100 元的收益，感受比从 1000 元到 1100 元更强烈</li>\n<li>从 0 元到 -100 元的损失，感受比从 -1000 元到 -1100 元更剧烈</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种结构自然解释了<strong>风险态度的四象限模式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>价值函数形态</th>\n<th>风险态度</th>\n<th>典型行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小概率收益</td>\n<td>过高权重</td>\n<td>风险偏好</td>\n<td>购买彩票</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大概率收益</td>\n<td>正常凹形</td>\n<td>风险厌恶</td>\n<td>接受确定性收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小概率损失</td>\n<td>过高权重</td>\n<td>风险偏好（接受赌局）</td>\n<td>购买保险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大概率损失</td>\n<td>凸形</td>\n<td>风险偏好（赌一把）</td>\n<td>破罐破摔，扩大损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"概率权重函数\">概率权重函数</h2><p>除了价值函数，前景理论的第二个核心是<strong>概率权重函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它描述人们对客观概率的主观扭曲。</p>\n<p>核心发现：人们<strong>高估小概率，低估中高概率</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    P1[客观概率 p] --&gt; W1[主观权重 w_p]&#10;    W1 --&gt; E1[小概率 p &lt; 0.1: w_p &gt;&gt; p, 过度高估]&#10;    W1 --&gt; E2[中等概率 p ≈ 0.3-0.5: w_p ≈ p]&#10;    W1 --&gt; E3[高概率 p &gt; 0.8: w_p &lt; p, 轻微低估]\">graph TD\n    P1[客观概率 p] --&gt; W1[主观权重 w_p]\n    W1 --&gt; E1[小概率 p &lt; 0.1: w_p &gt;&gt; p, 过度高估]\n    W1 --&gt; E2[中等概率 p ≈ 0.3-0.5: w_p ≈ p]\n    W1 --&gt; E3[高概率 p &gt; 0.8: w_p &lt; p, 轻微低估]</pre><p>Kahneman-Tversky（1992）的参数化形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>γ</mi></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.69</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p) = \\frac{p^\\gamma}{[p^\\gamma + (1-p)^\\gamma]^{1/\\gamma}}, \\quad \\gamma \\approx 0.69</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2954em;vertical-align:-0.954em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3414em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.69</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个倒 S 形的权重函数解释了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>人们为什么同时买保险（高估小概率损失）和彩票（高估小概率暴富）</li>\n<li>医疗语境中，&quot;1% 死亡率&quot;比&quot;99% 存活率&quot;更令人担忧</li>\n<li>安全措施的&quot;零风险偏好&quot;——把 2% 降到 0 比把 20% 降到 18% 心理价值更大</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前景理论的编辑阶段\">前景理论的编辑阶段</h2><p>Kahneman 和 Tversky 指出，在评估阶段之前，人们会对选项进行<strong>编辑</strong>（editing）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>编码</strong>（Coding）：确定参考点，将结果编码为收益或损失</li>\n<li><strong>合并</strong>（Combination）：将相同结果的概率合并</li>\n<li><strong>分离</strong>（Segregation）：将确定部分从风险部分分离</li>\n<li><strong>取消</strong>（Cancellation）：消除各选项的共同成分</li>\n<li><strong>简化</strong>（Simplification）：四舍五入概率和结果</li>\n<li><strong>主导性检测</strong>（Detection of Dominance）：直接拒绝劣选项</li>\n</ol>\n<p>编辑阶段解释了许多&quot;非理性&quot;偏好逆转现象——人们对同一实质内容的不同呈现方式，因为编辑步骤不同，得出不同判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"累积前景理论-修正与完善\">累积前景理论：修正与完善</h2><p>1992 年，Kahneman 和 Tversky 提出<strong>累积前景理论</strong>（Cumulative Prospect Theory，CPT），修正了原版理论在处理多结果概率时的随机优势一致性问题。</p>\n<p>CPT 对收益和损失分别使用不同的概率权重函数，并对累积分布函数（而非单个概率）施加权重，从而满足随机一致性。CPT 已成为行为经济学中描述风险决策的主流模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用案例-价格促销中的参考点操纵\">应用案例：价格促销中的参考点操纵</h2><p>理解价值函数在营销场景中极为有用。以下是典型应用：</p>\n<p><strong>划线价（Reference Pricing）</strong></p>\n<p>商家标注&quot;原价 200 元，现价 99 元&quot;，将消费者参考点锚定在 200 元。在这个参考点下，支付 99 元被编码为&quot;节省 101 元（收益）&quot;而非&quot;支出 99 元（损失）&quot;。由于参考点从&quot;零&quot;变为&quot;200&quot;，消费者主观价值大幅提升。</p>\n<p><strong>分离收益，合并损失</strong></p>\n<p>按照边际敏感度递减，把多个好消息分开展示（&quot;送你 50 元优惠券&quot;加&quot;还赠运费险&quot;加&quot;额外积分&quot;）比合并展示（&quot;综合优惠价值 60 元&quot;）让人更愉悦。反之，多个坏消息（多项额外费用）应该合并展示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>前景理论的三大核心——参考点依赖、损失厌恶、概率权重扭曲——构成了行为经济学应用的理论基石。理解这三点，才能在产品设计、定价策略与政策干预中有意识地运用（或规避）这些决策机制。</p>\n<p>本章后续的<a href=\"bounded-rationality\">有限理性</a>讨论了决策偏离的另一条路径——信息处理能力本身的局限，而<a href=\"heuristics-and-biases\">启发式与偏误</a>则系统梳理了由此产生的各类认知捷径及其副作用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前景理论与价值函数：行为经济学的核心模型","id":"前景理论与价值函数-行为经济学的核心模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"期望效用理论的困境","id":"期望效用理论的困境"},{"level":2,"text":"价值函数：三大特征","id":"价值函数-三大特征"},{"level":2,"text":"概率权重函数","id":"概率权重函数"},{"level":2,"text":"前景理论的编辑阶段","id":"前景理论的编辑阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"累积前景理论：修正与完善","id":"累积前景理论-修正与完善"},{"level":2,"text":"应用案例：价格促销中的参考点操纵","id":"应用案例-价格促销中的参考点操纵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"有限理性与生态理性：人脑的决策经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations/bounded-rationality"}}